                        "glosses": [
                            "A hair product that works against natural colour to make the hair more drab."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d865e3f-e3c9-40f1-a3a1-6844d9449e45",
                                "sense_id": "a35fe919-d6f9-3430-950e-2d70f72eec15",
                                "text": "In one-step hair coloring products such as Miss Clairol, where you can combine different shades, you can add drabbers, which are ashy substances that minimize the red hues that exist in your hair.\nI well know him\nFor a most insatiate drabber . He hath given,\nBefore he spent his own estate , which was\nNothing to the huge mass he's now possess'd of,\nA hundred pound a leap"
                            }
                        ]
